graph TD
    %% Carbon Source Sensing
    A[Carbon Source Available] --> B{OR: Respiratory<br/>or Fermentative?}
    B -->|Glycerol/Ethanol| C[Respiratory Growth Signal]
    B -->|Glucose| D[Fermentative Growth Signal]
    
    %% Glucose Repression
    D --> E[/Glucose Repression Active/]
    E --> F[/Mig1 Repressor Active/]
    F --> G[Low Mitochondrial Genes]
    G --> H([Minimal Mitochondria])
    
    %% Respiratory Activation
    C --> I[/Glucose Repression Relief/]
    I --> J[Snf1 AMPK Activation]
    J --> K[Mig1 Phosphorylation]
    K --> L[Mig1 Nuclear Export]
    
    %% Hap Complex Assembly
    L --> M{AND: Hap2/3/4<br/>Core Complex?}
    M -->|No - Missing Subunits| G
    M -->|Yes - Core Present| N[Hap2/3/4 Core Formed]
    
    N --> O{AND: Hap5<br/>Regulatory Subunit?}
    O -->|No| G
    O -->|Yes| P[Hap2/3/4/5 Complete Complex]
    
    %% Nuclear Mitochondrial Gene Activation
    P --> Q[Hap Complex DNA Binding]
    Q --> R[CCAAT Box Recognition]
    R --> S[Nuclear Mitochondrial Gene Transcription]
    
    %% OR Gate: Which Mitochondrial Genes?
    S --> T{OR: Which Gene<br/>Class?}
    T -->|Respiratory Chain| U[COX/CYC Gene Expression]
    T -->|TCA Cycle| V[CIT/ACO/IDH Gene Expression]
    T -->|Import Machinery| W[TOM/TIM Gene Expression]
    T -->|Matrix Enzymes| X[mtDNA Maintenance Genes]
    
    %% Precursor Protein Synthesis
    U --> Y[Cytoplasmic Translation]
    V --> Y
    W --> Y
    X --> Y
    Y --> Z[Precursor Proteins with MTS]
    Z --> AA[N-terminal Targeting Signal]
    
    %% Chaperone Binding
    AA --> AB[Hsp70/Hsp90 Chaperones]
    AB --> AC[Precursor Kept Unfolded]
    AC --> AD[Delivery to TOM Complex]
    
    %% TOM Complex Import
    AD --> AE[TOM70/TOM20 Receptors]
    AE --> AF{AND: Tom40<br/>Channel Present?}
    AF -->|No| AG[\Import Blocked/]
    AF -->|Yes| AH[Tom40 Pore Entry]
    
    AH --> AI{AND: Tom22<br/>Central Receptor?}
    AI -->|No| AG
    AI -->|Yes| AJ[Precursor Translocation]
    
    %% Mitochondrial Membrane Potential
    AJ --> AK{AND: ΔΨ Membrane<br/>Potential Present?}
    AK -->|No - Depolarized| AL[Import Stalled]
    AK -->|Yes - Polarized| AM[Import Continues]
    
    %% TIM Complex Sorting
    AM --> AN{OR: Which<br/>Destination?}
    AN -->|Matrix| AO[TIM23 Complex]
    AN -->|Inner Membrane| AP[TIM22 Complex]
    AN -->|Outer Membrane| AQ[SAM Complex]
    
    %% Matrix Import
    AO --> AR[mtHsp70 Motor]
    AR --> AS[Precursor Pulled In]
    AS --> AT[MPP Peptidase]
    AT --> AU[MTS Cleavage]
    AU --> AV[Mature Protein in Matrix]
    
    %% Mitochondrial Function Check
    AV --> AW{OR: Mitochondria<br/>Functional?}
    AW -->|Yes - Healthy| AX[Normal Biogenesis]
    AW -->|No - Dysfunctional| AY[RTG Retrograde Pathway]
    
    %% RTG Retrograde Signaling
    AY --> AZ[Rtg2 Sensor Activation]
    AZ --> BA[/Mks1 Inhibitor Inactivation/]
    BA --> BB[Rtg1/3 TF Nuclear Entry]
    BB --> BC[Compensatory Gene Expression]
    BC --> BD[TCA Anaplerotic Genes]
    BD --> BE[Metabolic Adaptation]
    BE --> BF([Dysfunction Compensation])
    
    %% Normal Output
    AX --> BG[Respiratory Chain Assembly]
    BG --> BH[ATP Synthase Complex]
    BH --> BI[Oxidative Phosphorylation]
    BI --> BJ([Functional Mitochondria])
    
